  "title": "TAT Technologies Announces Expansion of Group Sales Department & Opening New Centralized Sales Offices in Mooresville, NC",
  "summary": "GREENSBORO, NC, November 2020 – TAT Technologies recently announced two major expansion moves, implemented with the aim of strengthening the company’s presence in the US and expanding its portfolio of services. TAT Technologies recently announced the expansion of the Group Sales Department and opening new centralized sales offices in Mooresville, NC, to consolidate its presence […]",
